{"product":{"id":8476517269843,"title":"SYSTEM 4 BALANCING SHAMPOO 2","body_html":"\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eBALANCING SHAMPOO 2 BY SYSTEM 4\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eTherapeutic shampoo for dry scalp and colored hair\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eSpecial effective shampoo for deep care of colored hair and dry scalp. Reduces dandruff and soothes scalp itching and irritation. Specially developed to support the natural moisture balance of the scalp and hair and to protect the hair color. Contains salicylic acid, which acts as an exfoliating ingredient. Climbazole prevents dandruff. Suitable for everyday use. Product is not suitable for children under 3 years of age.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBENEFITS:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eSoothes dry itchy itching and irritation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eRemoves dandruff and prevents it from recurring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eProtects against hair color fading\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eIncreases hair shine\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eParfume free and dermatologically tested\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe bottle is made of 100% recycled plastic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUSAGE:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eApply shampoo thoroughly to hair \u0026amp; scalp. Leave on for 2-5 minutes and rinse. Longer exposure time than with regular shampoo.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003epH 4.7\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Rempire Tower Shop","product_type":"Shampoo","created_at":"2023-07-19T17:53:18+03:00","handle":"system-4-balancing-sh